    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University's East Africa Institute (EAI) has signed a partnership agreement with the Clean Cooking Alliance Kenya (CCAK). The agreement will see the two organisations undertake joint projects in research and development in the energy sector particularly within the context of clean cooking.",
